    <briefdescription>
<para>Linear feature-based Learning-to-Rank (LTR) re-ranker. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_learning_to_rank" kindref="compound">LearningToRank</ref> implements a supervised linear re-ranker trained from click-through data. It:</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Accepts a list of pre-scored candidates (e.g. from <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_hybrid_search" kindref="compound">HybridSearch</ref>) together with their <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1_ranking_features" kindref="compound">RankingFeatures</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Applies a learned weight vector to produce a <computeroutput>final_score</computeroutput> per candidate.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Provides a <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_learning_to_rank_1abb9c6e88b3a0597ef6ccdad26eb391a5" kindref="member">train()</ref></computeroutput> method that updates weights via online gradient descent using click-through events (position-based implicit feedback).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Offers an A/B variant selector (<computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_learning_to_rank_1a49d636fee815be3ed9cb7c42dd7f422f" kindref="member">selectVariant()</ref></computeroutput>) for controlled experiments.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><heading level="3">Workflow</heading>
</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal">LearningToRank::Config<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.learning_rate<sp/>=<sp/>0.01;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_learning_to_rank_1a6d78ae4af013bf326f53b0bcef68f6e8" kindref="member">LearningToRank</ref><sp/>ltr(cfg);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Re-rank<sp/>results</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::vector&lt;RankedResult&gt;<sp/>candidates<sp/>=<sp/>buildCandidates(hs_results,<sp/>features);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ranked<sp/>=<sp/>ltr.rerank(candidates);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Collect<sp/>clicks<sp/>and<sp/>train</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ltr.recordClick({</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;machine<sp/>learning&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;doc_42&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>3});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ltr.train();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Thread Safety: A single <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_learning_to_rank" kindref="compound">LearningToRank</ref> instance is NOT thread-safe. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Exception Safety: All methods are noexcept at runtime; the constructor throws <computeroutput>std::invalid_argument</computeroutput> on invalid config. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
